# Optional fallback for users who prefer the CLI/dev workflow.
# The Chrome extension's setup screen is the primary way to provide a key —
# it stores the key in chrome.storage.local and sends it as a header on each
# request, so the helper never persists secrets to disk.
#
# Copy this file to .env and uncomment the line below if you'd rather export
# the key from the helper process itself.
#
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-api03-...
